{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Their wealth</b> — with their wisdom it is their splendor and the crown of their head, for wealth benefits wisdom." "<b>And the folly of fools</b> — and even though they have wealth, it will not benefit them to remove it from them, for their folly in their wealth is folly, or folly like none other."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:48.289473166Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}